        "title": "Jeremiah's Prophecies During Siege",
        "introduction": "The focus returns to Jerusalem. With Nebuchadnezzar's army just outside the walls, Zedekiah realizes that it is time to consult God. But the answer from Jeremiah is to surrender or be destroyed."
      },
      {
        "title": "",
        "paragraphs": [
